Loading BLIP Model
Load the BLIP Model and Processor from Hugging Face
Hugging Face is an open-source platform that provides pre-trained machine learning models, datasets, and tools, primarily focused on natural language processing, computer vision, and other AI tasks.
It offers easy access to powerful models through its Transformers library.

BlipProcessor: This handles the preprocessing of images and text.
It converts images to the format that the BLIP model can understand.

